WEBVTT

00:06:29.142 --> 00:06:31.348
would love to see you fly this drone

00:06:31.348 --> 00:06:34.513
from your bed in California 3,000 miles away.

00:06:34.513 --> 00:06:39.370
(Applause)

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.330
Okay, Henry, have you been to D.C. lately?

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.838
(Laughter)

00:06:52.838 --> 00:06:56.347
Are you excited to be at TEDxMidAtlantic?

00:06:56.347 --> 00:07:00.684
(Laughter) (Applause)